{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Find The Flaw&quot;</strong> redefines the traditional spot-the-differences genre with a fresh, polished approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience nice 3D isometric environments, accompanied by meticulously crafted ambient music. Engage in an unhurried search for cleverly concealed discrepancies, transforming a timeless game concept into something new and exciting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307250/extras/bc35a1b2b37d33bd197ecf5701f8dd30.avif?t=1746769716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307250/extras_big/bc35a1b2b37d33bd197ecf5701f8dd30.avif?t=1746769716 width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the meticulously designed <strong>Find The Flaw</strong> worlds, where each scene is a masterpiece of detail. Relax within the tranquil soundscapes of the game's music as you challenge your mind with intricate puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studies suggest that playing these games can enhance your focus and boost your short-term memory, offering both entertainment and cognitive benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307250/extras/f221e128dbdeaebe6f4bbf6c8f11e2ae.avif?t=1746769716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307250/extras_big/f221e128dbdeaebe6f4bbf6c8f11e2ae.avif?t=1746769716 width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there, <strong>Frank\u00a0Eno</strong>\u00a0here. I have been creating escape room and puzzle games since 2020 under the name of\u00a0<strong>XSGames</strong>, doing everything\u00a0myself: code, graphics, music, design, concept, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Let's Start!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3307250/e45a10e25c700cba91033108e893e2d13a439336.jpg"},{"name":"20 Levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3307250/71829de7aab78ca674028dd089e3e4b1468ed3db.jpg"},{"name":"40 Levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3307250/8260a4b620756eb5a0cc413c9afb955c11d9e83c.jpg"},{"name":"60 levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3307250/c19348fa93062ceed8faa87a0350f307232c89c9.jpg"},{"name":"80 levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3307250/7cb55bf53d7f18732391bef5788e89cd304313c6.jpg"},{"name":"Last level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3307250/784d1ac0a185a4ee0a1ee648a4e3c7b8b4c5e6e5.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3307250?t=1746769716","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3307250?t=1746769716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307250/ff3770f034a26d53d14a2356a8e627f0994f61ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746769716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307250/ff3770f034a26d53d14a2356a8e627f0994f61ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746769716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Find The Flaw&quot;</strong> redefines the traditional spot-the-differences genre with a fresh, polished approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience nice 3D iso